# Screen Titles
screen.LIGHTING=Lighting & Atmosphere
screen.SHADOWS=Shadow Configuration
screen.SKY=Sky & Clouds
screen.WATER=Water & Reflections
screen.WORLD=World & Vegetation
screen.POST=Post-Processing & Camera

# Profiles
profile.POTATO=Potato (Minimal)
profile.LOW=Low (Lightweight)
profile.MEDIUM=Medium (Balanced)
profile.HIGH=High (PBR Gameplay)
profile.ULTRA=Ultra (Detailed Gameplay)
profile.EXTREME=Extreme (Full-resolution Lighting)
profile.comment=Potato/Low: lightweight rendering. Medium: temporal AO and exposure. High/Ultra: PBR, contact shadows and temporal GI. Realism: neutral gameplay; FSR and higher tracing variants available. Extreme/Cinematic: lens effects.

# Lighting Options
option.SSAO=Screen-Space Ambient Occlusion
option.SSAO.comment=Screen-space occlusion attenuates the stored ambient fraction, preserving direct light and emission approximately. Half-resolution mode can use its own temporal history.
option.SSAO_SAMPLES=SSAO Sample Count
option.SSAO_SAMPLES.comment=Number of depth samples used to compute ambient occlusion. Lower values give more performance on potato devices.
option.SSGI=Screen-Space Indirect Light
option.SSGI.comment=Visible-surface diffuse bounce weighted by material reflectance, hit confidence and back-face rejection. No off-screen geometry or multi-bounce path tracing.
option.GI_SAMPLES=Indirect Light Rays
option.GI_STRENGTH=Indirect Light Intensity
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=Volumetric God Rays
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Renders light shafts through the atmosphere based on sunlight and shadows.
option.VL_SAMPLES=God Ray Sample Steps
option.NIGHT_BRIGHTNESS=Moonlight Brightness
option.CAVE_BRIGHTNESS=Cave & Ambient Brightness
option.CAVE_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Minimum ambient light level in caves and dark interiors.
option.TORCH_BRIGHTNESS=Torch & Lantern Brightness

# Shadow Options
option.SHADOWS=Real-Time Dynamic Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Renders real-time sun and moon shadows. Disabling dynamic shadows gives the biggest FPS boost.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Map Resolution
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES=Shadow Softness & Samples
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=1 sample gives hard shadow edges. Higher counts filter shadow edges at additional GPU cost.
option.SHADOW_ALPHA_TEST=Shadow Alpha Cutouts
option.SHADOW_ALPHA_TEST.comment=Preserves leaf and plant cutouts in shadows. Disable only if solid foliage silhouettes are acceptable.
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS=Moving Cloud Shadows
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Angle & Path Rotation

# Sky Options
option.CLOUDS=Clouds
value.CLOUDS.0=Off
value.CLOUDS.1=Fast 2D
value.CLOUDS.2=Volumetric 3D
option.CLOUDS.comment=Cloud rendering mode. Fast 2D is ultra lightweight for potato and low-end devices. Volumetric 3D gives realistic raymarched clouds.
option.CLOUD_DETAIL=Cloud Billow Detail (3D Noise)
option.CLOUD_DETAIL.comment=Adds fine cauliflower billow micro-texture to clouds. Disable on low-end devices to skip 3D noise calculations.
option.CLOUD_STEPS=Cloud Raymarch Steps
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud Coverage
option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE=Cloud Base Altitude
option.STARS=Night Sky Stars
option.SUN_MOON_GLOW=Sun & Moon Corona Glow
option.FOG_ENABLED=Atmospheric Fog
option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog Density

# Water Options
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Underwater Optical Refraction
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=Refracts light passing through water surfaces. Disable on potato devices to avoid double depth buffer sampling.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Underwater Caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Animated dancing sunlight patterns on riverbeds and ocean floors.
option.SSR=Screen-Space Reflections
option.SSR.comment=Visible depth/color rays for water and reflective materials. Matte dielectrics use one broad sky-cache lookup; glossy/metal surfaces retain filtered reflections. No off-screen world geometry.
option.SSR_STEPS=Reflection Ray Steps
option.WATER_OCTAVES=Wave Detail Octaves
option.WATER_OCTAVES.comment=Number of wave frequencies computed for water normals. Set to 2 for maximum FPS on potato devices.
option.WATER_WAVES=Wave Height & Strength
option.WATER_CLARITY=Water Clarity
option.WATER_ROUGHNESS=Water Surface Roughness

# World & Materials Options
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE=Master Foliage Wind Animation
option.WAVING_PLANTS=Waving Grass, Flowers & Crops
option.WAVING_LEAVES=Waving Tree Leaves
option.WIND_SPEED=Wind Speed
option.RAIN_PUDDLES=Rain Puddles & Wet Surfaces
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=Creates glossy water puddles on ground blocks during rainfall. Turn off to boost rain performance.
option.RESOURCE_NORMALS=Resource Pack Normal Maps

# Post-Processing & Color Grading Options
option.COLOR_PROFILE=Color Look / Variant
value.COLOR_PROFILE.0=Natural (Balanced)
value.COLOR_PROFILE.1=Vibrant Fantasy
value.COLOR_PROFILE.2=Cinematic Teal & Orange
value.COLOR_PROFILE.3=Golden Hour (Warm)
value.COLOR_PROFILE.4=Cold Nordic (Boreal)
value.COLOR_PROFILE.5=Retro 35mm Film
value.COLOR_PROFILE.6=Bleach Bypass (Gritty)
value.COLOR_PROFILE.7=Cyberpunk (Electric Neon)
option.COLOR_PROFILE.comment=Stylistic color grading variants. Changes overall color palette, mood, and atmospheric toning.
option.TONEMAP_OPERATOR=Tonemapping Curve
value.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.0=ACES Filmic
value.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.1=AgX-style (Approximation)
value.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.2=Khronos PBR Neutral
value.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.3=Uncharted 2 (Hable)
value.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.4=Reinhard-Jodie
value.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.5=Linear (Clipped)
option.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.comment=HDR highlight compression. ACES, simplified AgX-style, PBR Neutral, Hable, Reinhard-Jodie or clipped linear output.
option.COLOR_VIBRANCE=Smart Vibrance
option.COLOR_VIBRANCE.comment=Intelligently boosts muted colors without over-saturating already vibrant blocks or skin tones.
option.COLOR_SATURATION=Color Saturation
option.COLOR_CONTRAST=Color Contrast
option.EXPOSURE=Camera Exposure
option.COLOR_TEMPERATURE=White Balance Temperature
option.COLOR_TEMPERATURE.comment=Shifts color balance between warm amber/gold and cool arctic blue.
option.COLOR_TINT=White Balance Tint
option.COLOR_TINT.comment=Adjusts color tint between green and magenta.
option.BLOOM=Bloom Glow Effect
option.BLOOM.comment=Produces soft glowing halos around bright lights. Bypassed entirely when disabled.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Intensity
option.TAA=Temporal Stabilization
option.TAA.comment=Depth-validated HDR history with neighborhood clipping and camera reprojection. Pair with FXAA for geometry edges; this mode does not jitter geometry.
option.TAA_BLEND=TAA Temporal Accumulation
option.TAA_BLEND.comment=Weight of previous frame accumulation. Higher values give maximum temporal stability; lower values increase camera responsiveness.
option.TAA_SHARPENING=TAA Contrast-Adaptive Sharpening
option.TAA_SHARPENING.comment=Sharpens the current resolved image without feeding sharpening into temporal history. Replaced by RCAS when FSR 1 is active.
option.TAA_SHARPEN_STRENGTH=TAA Sharpness
option.TAA_SHARPEN_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the intensity of the sharpening filter. Higher values produce extra crisp edges; lower values give a softer, cinematic image.
option.FXAA=Fast Approximate Anti-Aliasing (FXAA)
option.FXAA.comment=Screen-space edge smoothing filter. Works alongside TAA to deliver clean geometric anti-aliasing without screen shaking.
option.VIGNETTE=Camera Lens Vignette
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Vignette Intensity
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION=Chromatic Aberration
option.CHROMATIC_ABERRATION.comment=Simulates physical camera lens optical dispersion towards screen edges.
option.CA_STRENGTH=Aberration Strength
option.FILM_GRAIN=35mm Film Grain
option.FILM_GRAIN.comment=Adds subtle, organic analog film grain to enhance cinematic realism and break color banding.
option.FILM_GRAIN_STRENGTH=Film Grain Intensity
option.COLOR_DITHERING=Ordered Color Dithering

screen.CAMERA=Camera & Motion Effects
screen.PARTICLES=Particles & Weather
option.MOTION_BLUR=Motion Blur
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Simulates camera shutter exposure blur during movement and rotation.
option.MOTION_BLUR_LOW_LATENCY=Reduced Motion Blur
option.MOTION_BLUR_LOW_LATENCY.comment=Caps blur at 5 samples and reduces trail radius. Only affects enabled motion blur; does not control input or display latency.
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH=Motion Blur Strength
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the duration of motion trails. 0.50 corresponds to a cinematic 180-degree shutter angle.
option.MOTION_BLUR_SAMPLES=Motion Blur Samples
option.MOTION_BLUR_SAMPLES.comment=Number of samples gathered along the motion trail. Higher counts produce smoother trails at slightly higher GPU cost.
option.MOTION_BLUR_HAND=Blur Hand & Held Item
option.MOTION_BLUR_HAND.comment=Applies motion blur to the first-person hand and held item. Turn off to keep the hand crisp during camera rotation.
option.RESOURCE_SPECULAR=LabPBR Specular & Emission
option.RESOURCE_SPECULAR.comment=LabPBR 1.3: linear F0, conductor constants for metal IDs 230-237 with albedo tint, albedo-F0 fallback for other metals, emission and subsurface data. Porosity affects rain darkening and puddles.
option.SPECULAR_AA=Filter Specular Shimmer
option.SPECULAR_AA.comment=Broadens subpixel highlights to reduce sparkling on moving water and normal maps.
option.SOFT_PARTICLES=Soft Particle Intersections
option.SOFT_PARTICLES.comment=Fades translucent particles against opaque terrain. Does not generate new particles.
option.PARTICLE_SOFTNESS=Particle Fade Distance
option.PARTICLE_LIGHTING=Particle Sunlight & Shadows
option.WEATHER_OPACITY=Rain & Snow Opacity
option.DOF=Depth of Field
option.DOF.comment=Lens blur before tone mapping. Focused pixels skip the blur loop. Disable for the sharpest gameplay and lower GPU cost.
option.DOF_AUTOFOCUS=Autofocus
option.DOF_AUTOFOCUS.comment=Uses smoothed crosshair depth. Disable to set a fixed focus distance.
option.DOF_FOCUS_DISTANCE=Manual Focus Distance (Blocks)
option.DOF_FOCAL_LENGTH=Focal Length (mm)
option.DOF_FSTOP=Aperture (f-number)
option.DOF_FSTOP.comment=Lower values produce more background blur. This controls blur independently of camera exposure.
option.DOF_SAMPLES=Bokeh Samples
option.DOF_MAX_RADIUS=Maximum Blur Radius (Pixels)

option.POM=Parallax Occlusion Mapping (POM)
option.POM.comment=Terrain relief from LabPBR normal-map alpha. Requires Resource Pack Normal Maps. Leaves, plants and distant LODs are excluded. Does not change silhouettes or geometry depth.
option.POM_STEPS=Maximum Parallax Steps
option.POM_STEPS.comment=Adaptive view-angle sample budget, followed by 3 refinement samples. Higher counts resolve narrow grooves at higher GPU cost.
option.POM_DEPTH=Parallax Depth
option.POM_DEPTH.comment=Maximum relief relative to a texture tile. LabPBR standard depth is 0.25. Zero disables displacement.
option.POM_DISTANCE=Parallax Distance (Blocks)
option.POM_DISTANCE.comment=Fades out starting at 65% of this distance and skips height tracing beyond it.

screen.PERFORMANCE=Performance & Reconstruction
option.CLOUD_RECONSTRUCTION=Reconstruct Volumetric Clouds
option.CLOUD_RECONSTRUCTION.comment=March clouds at half width/height; preserve the native-resolution sky. Disable for the full-resolution reference.
option.TEMPORAL_CLOUDS=Cloud History
option.TEMPORAL_CLOUDS.comment=Reproject and clamp previous cloud samples. Requires cloud reconstruction. Disable if trails are visible.
option.HALF_RES_LIGHTING=Reconstruct Indirect Lighting
option.HALF_RES_LIGHTING.comment=Half-resolution AO/GI with depth, normal and emission rejection. Difficult edges use full-resolution sampling.
option.HALF_RES_DOF=Reconstruct Lens Blur
option.HALF_RES_DOF.comment=Gather large bokeh at half width/height. Focus, hands and depth edges retain full-resolution handling.

option.UPSCALE_QUALITY=AMD FSR 1 Upscaling
option.UPSCALE_QUALITY.comment=Spatial upscaling, available on Windows and macOS. Native preserves original resolution. Lower render resolution trades fine detail for GPU time. Does not generate frames.
value.UPSCALE_QUALITY.0=Native (100%)
value.UPSCALE_QUALITY.1=Ultra Quality (77%)
value.UPSCALE_QUALITY.2=Quality (67%)
value.UPSCALE_QUALITY.3=Balanced (59%)
option.UPSCALE_SHARPNESS=FSR RCAS Sharpness
option.UPSCALE_SHARPNESS.comment=Sharpen the upscaled image with AMD RCAS. Zero disables sharpening.

profile.REALISM=Realism (Gameplay)
profile.REALISM.comment=Natural gameplay at native resolution: 2048 shadows, 3 GI rays, 24 SSR steps, 16 cloud steps, mild haze/bloom. Temporal GI/AO, neutral tone mapping; DOF/motion blur off.

screen.RAYTRACING=Ray Tracing (Screen Space)
screen.RAYTRACING.comment=Depth-buffer ray marching for reflections and indirect light. No hardware RT, off-screen geometry or path tracing.
profile.REALISM_FSR=Realism + FSR Ultra Quality
profile.REALISM_FSR.comment=Natural Realism effects with 77% internal width/height and FSR 1 EASU/RCAS. Lower shading cost with a fine-detail tradeoff; no frame generation.
profile.REALISM_RT=Realism + High Screen-Space Tracing
profile.REALISM_CINEMA=Realism Cinematic (4K Shadow Map)
profile.REALISM_CINEMA.comment=Native resolution, 4096 shadow map, 4 GI rays, 40 SSR steps, 20 cloud steps. Neutral tone mapping and temporal GI/AO; f/4 DOF and motion blur on. Higher GPU cost.
profile.REALISM_RT.comment=Natural Realism with 4 GI rays, 40 SSR steps, 20 cloud steps and 8 shadow taps. More screen-space tracing; no off-screen geometry.

option.CONTACT_HARDENING_SHADOWS=Contact-hardening sun shadows
option.CONTACT_HARDENING_SHADOWS.comment=Four blocker taps estimate solar penumbra, capped at five texels. Requires shadows with 6 or 8 filter samples; adds GPU work.

option.AUTO_EXPOSURE=Adaptive camera exposure
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment=64 opaque HDR luminance samples drive bounded 0.35-3.0 exposure. Faster adaptation to bright scenes, slower to darkness; applied before tone mapping.

option.TEMPORAL_INDIRECT=Temporal GI/AO
option.TEMPORAL_INDIRECT.comment=Reprojects GI/AO with per-tap depth and world-normal checks. Requires half-resolution lighting. Moving entities, camera cuts and invalid history reject reuse.

option.EXPOSURE.comment=Manual exposure multiplier. With adaptive exposure enabled it scales the metered result; otherwise uses the day/night baseline.

profile.POTATO.comment=Minimal effects, neutral tone mapping. Shadows, clouds, GI, SSR, adaptive exposure and history off.

profile.LOW.comment=512 shadows with 2-tap PCF, 2D clouds, FXAA and neutral tone mapping. GI and adaptive exposure off.

profile.MEDIUM.comment=1024 shadows, temporal AO, 16-step SSR, 10-step half-resolution clouds, adaptive exposure and neutral tone mapping. No PBR/POM or diffuse GI.

profile.HIGH.comment=2048 contact-hardening shadows, 3 GI rays, 28 SSR steps, 16 cloud steps. Temporal GI/AO, LabPBR/POM, neutral daylight and tone mapping; lens blur off.

profile.ULTRA.comment=2048 shadows, 4 GI rays, 32 SSR steps, 20 cloud steps, 24 POM steps. Temporal GI/AO and neutral tone mapping; lens blur off.

profile.EXTREME.comment=4096 shadows, native AO/GI without indirect history, 6 GI rays and 56 SSR steps. Neutral tone mapping, adaptive exposure, DOF, motion blur and grain on.

option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Distance haze density. Clear air leaves the first 12 blocks unattenuated; horizon haze remains. Rain and underwater extinction are handled separately.
